Implements: do-work/working/REQ-177-exercise-enabled-timeline-step-navigation.md

The fixed fixture pinned every arrow press in this probe to the REFUSAL branch, so
TestBrowserBehaviorTimelineNowAndFitAllLandSomewhereReadable proved the step buttons
say no and never that they say yes. Two permanently disabled arrows satisfied both
strict suites.

- After the existing refused forward press — which leaves the window where it was —
  press Previous and then Next, capturing toolbar state after each
- Clause (3): the two-branch conditional is gone. The fixture pins the refusal regime,
  so the refusal is asserted outright: the arrow must report itself disabled and the
  press must not move the window
- Clause (3b), new: Previous must be enabled, must move both endpoints back exactly
  seven days, must preserve the span, and must leave data drawn; Next must be enabled
  and must return both endpoints to the exact starting instants, still drawing
- Endpoints compared as instants, not readout text, so a wrong-sized step cannot pass
  by rendering the same string

Both discrimination cases the REQ specified now fail the test:
  1. Permanently disabled buttons (false && movesTheWindow(...)) — "the step-back arrow
     reported itself disabled on the last seven days (2026-08-24 12:00 UTC → 2026-08-31
     12:00 UTC) ... the fixed payload has 86 days of range before that window"
  2. No-op step click handlers — "started the window at 2026-08-24 12:00 UTC, want
     2026-08-17 12:00 UTC — one screenful earlier", plus two more
The second case the old conditional could not catch in either arm. Both mutations
reverted; board-timeline.js byte-identical.

The capture's Node-derived prediction is confirmed in a real browser: initial window
2026-08-24 12:00 → 2026-08-31 12:00 UTC, Previous → 2026-08-17 12:00 → 2026-08-24 12:00,
Next returns exactly.

Supersedes REQ-174's D-03 in the current file only; the archived REQ-174 is untouched.
Its intent — that the contract holds in both regimes — is kept as prose, which is where
a contract about a regime this fixture cannot produce belongs.

maintainer-check ALL GREEN, strict browser lane 63.9s.

